<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine vegoil export prices June 13.</title>
<headline>Argentine vegoil export prices June 13.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRE 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine vegoil export offer/bid prices were as follows, traders said. (FOB in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>     Soy oil    Jul 526/522 Aug +30/522 Sep 530/522</p>
<p>		    Oct/Nov/Dec +40/+10</p>
<p>     Sunoil     Jul 528/521 Aug 532/523</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
